## Commands```



| Command | Status | Description |## Current Implementation Status

|---------|--------|-------------|

| `init` | ✅ Working | Initialize configuration and API tokens |### ✅ Working Features

| `setup` | ✅ Working | Create VPS with firewall + updates |

| `connect` | ✅ Working | SSH into your VPS |- **`init`** - Interactive wizard to create configuration

| `harden` | ⚠️ Partial | Shows security hardening commands |- **`setup`** - Creates VPS droplet with firewall on DigitalOcean

| `deploy` | 🔄 Redirects | Redirects to setup (not yet implemented) |- **`harden`** - Shows security hardening commands

| `upload` | ❌ Planned | Upload application files |- **`deploy`** - Creates VPS (but doesn't upload/configure yet)

| `logs` | ❌ Planned | Retrieve VPS logs |

| `status` | ❌ Planned | Check VPS status |### ⚠️ Partially Working

| `destroy` | ❌ Planned | Destroy VPS and cleanup |

| `ssl-setup` | ❌ Planned | Configure SSL certificates |- **`deploy`** - Only creates the VPS, doesn't upload files, configure NGINX, SSL, or DNS

| `ssl-renew` | ❌ Planned | Renew SSL certificates |

| `dns-add` | ❌ Planned | Add DNS record |### ❌ Not Yet Implemented

| `dns-remove` | ❌ Planned | Remove DNS record |

- **`connect`** - SSH connection testing

