## Workflow Design- [ ] Add dependency installation (language-specific)

- [ ] Implement NGINX configuration generation

The tool follows this clear workflow:- [ ] Setup NGINX reverse proxy rules

- [ ] Integrate Let's Encrypt for SSL certificates

1. **`init`** - One-time setup: collect API tokens, generate/configure SSH keys- [ ] Configure automatic SSL renewal

2. **`setup`** - Interactive VPS creation: choose region/size, create VPS, configure firewall, run updates- [ ] Setup DNS records via provider API

3. **`deploy`** - (Coming soon) Upload and configure your application- [ ] Implement subdomain creation and validation

4. **`connect`** - SSH access to your VPS- [ ] Add application service management (systemd)

5. **`harden`** - Additional security hardening- [ ] Create startup scripts for application

6. **Other commands** - Management, monitoring, cleanup- [ ] Implement health checks after deployment

- [ ] Add rollback mechanism for failed deployments

